    <div class="faq-list" style="max-width:720px;margin:48px auto 0;text-align:left;">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          Is there really no large design deposit?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">There's no large upfront design fee — no $1,500 deposit, no $4,000 up front. You sign a simple service agreement, make your first monthly payment of $175, and we begin designing your website immediately. It's structured this way specifically for small businesses that don't have thousands sitting around to spend on a website before they've even seen a single page.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          What happens if I cancel before 12 months?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Because we invest real time and resources building your site upfront at no charge to you, the 12-month minimum is how we make the economics work for both sides. If you cancel before 12 months, you'd owe the remaining balance of what a standard lump-sum build would have cost ($4,000), minus the monthly payments you've already made. After the 12 months, you're completely free — cancel anytime with 30 days' notice, no questions asked.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          Do I get to keep my site if I cancel after 12 months?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">With the monthly subscription, the code belongs to us — you're essentially licensing the website. When you cancel, the site comes down. However, if you've been a subscriber for 12+ months and decide to cancel, we're happy to discuss a buyout price so you can take the code with you. We've never had a client want to leave, but we'll always be straight with you about your options.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          Are there any hidden fees I should know about?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">No hidden fees. $175/month is the price, and that covers everything listed above. Your domain is always yours — you register and own it, paid directly to whichever registrar you choose (typically $15–20/year). We never own or control your domain. We'll walk you through everything before we start so there are zero surprises.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
